## This file is assumed to be used ONLY for develeopment environment.
## Using this for production environment will no take effect.

## Mysql server settings:
## Password for mysql `root` user (used once on container first running)
MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD=root

## Game server database names:
DB_WORLD_DB=world
DB_AUTH_DB=realmd
DB_CHARACTERS_1_DB=characters

## Website database credentials:
DB_USERNAME=mangos
## If user is `root` keep value as same as `MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD`
DB_PASSWORD=mangos

## Setup
## `SETUP_SKIP=0` will download & create empty game server databases, and `SETUP_SKIP=1` will not.
SETUP_SKIP=0
